              lower-grade gliomas that were more concordant with IDH, 1p/19q,
              and TP53 status than with histologic class. Lower-grade gliomas
              with an IDH mutation either had 1p/19q codeletion or carried a
              TP53 mutation. Most lower-grade gliomas without an IDH mutation
              were molecularly and clinically similar to glioblastoma. (Funded
